@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam titleBorderColor #000000
skinparam titleBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam titleBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontStyle bold

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #000000
    ArrowThickness 1.2
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #000000
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoxBorderColor #000000
    BoxBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    GroupBorderColor #000000
    GroupHeaderFontColor #000000
    GroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    DividerBorderColor #000000
    DividerBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    DividerFontColor #000000
    DividerFontSize 12
    DividerFontStyle bold
}

title Sequence Diagram: Mengunduh Laporan Diagnostik Sesi (UC-18)

actor "Audio Engineer" as User

box "Presentation Layer (Frontend)"
boundary "Modal Laporan Diagnostik\n(Web UI Dialog)" as UI
end box

box "Application & Business Logic Layer (Backend API)"
control "ReportController\n(API Gateway)" as ReportCtrl
control "AuthMiddleware\n(JWT Guard)" as AuthGuard
entity "AuditReportService\n(Report Orchestrator)" as ReportSvc
control "PdfRenderWorker\n(Headless PDF Engine)" as PdfWorker
end box

box "External Storage / Infrastructure"
control "Cloud Object Storage\n(S3 / MinIO Reports)" as Storage
end box

box "Persistence Layer"
database "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
end box

autonumber 1 "[00]"

== Fase 1: Pemuatan Pratinjau Laporan & Opsi Kustomisasi ==

User -> UI : Klik tombol "Unduh Laporan Audit (PDF)" pada Ringkasan Sesi
activate User
activate UI

UI -> ReportCtrl : GET /api/v1/sessions/{id}/report/preview (Bearer JWT)
activate ReportCtrl

ReportCtrl -> AuthGuard : validateSession(token)
activate AuthGuard
AuthGuard --> ReportCtrl : SessionValid (user_id)
deactivate AuthGuard

ReportCtrl -> ReportSvc : getReportPreviewData(session_id, user_id)
activate ReportSvc

ReportSvc -> DB : SELECT project_name, artist, studio_logo_url, session_health_score, tracks_count, phase_summary FROM sessions JOIN users ON sessions.user_id = users.id WHERE sessions.id = ?
activate DB
DB --> ReportSvc : SessionSummary & StudioBranding
deactivate DB

ReportSvc --> ReportCtrl : PreviewPayload (branding, metadata, format_options)
deactivate ReportSvc

ReportCtrl --> UI : 200 OK (preview_data)
deactivate ReportCtrl

UI --> User : Render modal pratinjau: opsi logo studio, nama proyek, artis, & format ekspor (PDF / JSON)
deactivate UI

== Fase 2: Konfirmasi & Kompilasi Dokumen PDF Resmi (Typical Course) ==

User -> UI : Pilih "PDF Resmi", konfirmasi kop studio, dan klik "Konfirmasi & Unduh PDF"
activate UI

UI -> ReportCtrl : POST /api/v1/sessions/{id}/report/generate (format='PDF', include_branding=true)
activate ReportCtrl

ReportCtrl -> ReportSvc : queuePdfGeneration(session_id, user_id, config)
activate ReportSvc

ReportSvc -> DB : SELECT * FROM diagnostic_metrics WHERE session_id = ?
activate DB
DB --> ReportSvc : FullDiagnosticMetrics (health_score, phase_matrices, issues, applied_fixes)
deactivate DB

ReportSvc -> PdfWorker : dispatch(RenderPdfReportJob(session_id, metrics, branding))
activate PdfWorker
PdfWorker --> ReportSvc : JobDispatched (ws_channel)
deactivate PdfWorker

ReportSvc --> ReportCtrl : PdfGenerationQueued (job_id, ws_channel)
deactivate ReportSvc

ReportCtrl --> UI : 202 Accepted (generation_in_progress)
deactivate ReportCtrl

UI --> User : Tampilkan status: "Mengompilasi laporan audit teknis dan grafik fasa..."

activate PdfWorker
PdfWorker -> PdfWorker : Evaluasi jumlah trek sesi (misal: 24 trek <= 50 trek)
PdfWorker -> PdfWorker : Render grafik fasa vektor, skor kesehatan sesi (95-100), kop studio, & tabel perbaikan
PdfWorker -> Storage : Simpan berkas PDF (Audit_Report_[Project]_[Date].pdf)
activate Storage
Storage --> PdfWorker : UploadSuccess (pdf_storage_key)
deactivate Storage

PdfWorker -> DB : INSERT INTO session_reports (session_id, report_type='PDF', storage_url=?)
activate DB
DB --> PdfWorker : ReportRecordCreated
deactivate DB

PdfWorker --> ReportSvc : PdfRenderCompleted (pdf_storage_key)
activate ReportSvc
deactivate PdfWorker

ReportSvc -> Storage : generatePresignedDownloadUrl(pdf_storage_key, expiresIn=1h)
activate Storage
Storage --> ReportSvc : PresignedPdfUrl
deactivate Storage

ReportSvc -> UI : WebSocket push: EVENT_REPORT_PDF_READY (download_url)
deactivate ReportSvc

UI -> Storage : Trigger direct browser download (GET presigned PDF URL)
activate Storage
Storage --> UI : Stream binary PDF document (Content-Type: application/pdf)
deactivate Storage

UI --> User : Berkas PDF tersimpan otomatis di komputer lokal & konfirmasi unduhan selesai
deactivate UI

== Fase 3: Opsi Alur Alternatif (Tanpa Logo & Ekspor JSON) ==

alt [Alternative Workflow 1: Laporan Standar Tanpa Logo Studio]
  User -> UI : Pilih opsi "Format Standar (Tanpa Logo Studio)"
  activate UI
  UI -> ReportCtrl : POST /api/v1/sessions/{id}/report/generate (format='PDF', include_branding=false)
  activate ReportCtrl
  ReportCtrl -> ReportSvc : generateStandardPdf(session_id)
  activate ReportSvc
  ReportSvc -> PdfWorker : dispatch(RenderStandardPdfJob())
  activate PdfWorker
  PdfWorker -> PdfWorker : Kompilasi dokumen PDF dengan kop standar resmi Polaris Audio
  PdfWorker --> ReportSvc : StandardPdfCompleted
  deactivate PdfWorker
  ReportSvc --> ReportCtrl : StandardPdfReady
  deactivate ReportSvc
  ReportCtrl --> UI : 200 OK (standard_download_url)
  deactivate ReportCtrl
  UI --> User : Dokumen PDF ber-kop standar Polaris Audio berhasil diunduh
  deactivate UI

else [Alternative Workflow 2: Ekspor Format Data Terstruktur (JSON)]
  User -> UI : Pilih opsi "Ekspor Data Metrik (.JSON)"
  activate UI
  UI -> ReportCtrl : GET /api/v1/sessions/{id}/report/json (Bearer JWT)
  activate ReportCtrl
  ReportCtrl -> ReportSvc : exportStructuredJsonMetrics(session_id)
  activate ReportSvc
  ReportSvc -> DB : SELECT raw_metrics_json FROM diagnostic_metrics WHERE session_id = ?
  activate DB
  DB --> ReportSvc : RawMetricsJsonData
  deactivate DB
  ReportSvc --> ReportCtrl : JsonExportPayload
  deactivate ReportSvc
  ReportCtrl --> UI : 200 OK (Content-Type: application/json)
  deactivate ReportCtrl
  UI --> User : Berkas .JSON terstruktur tersimpan untuk integrasi manajemen studio internal
  deactivate UI
end

== Fase 4: Penanganan Sesi Skala Masif (> 50 Trek) (Exceptional Workflow) ==

opt [Exceptional Workflow: Sesi Berukuran Masif (> 50 Trek) - Fallback Laporan Ringkas]
  activate PdfWorker
  PdfWorker -> PdfWorker : Deteksi jumlah trek > 50 trek (Beban render grafik vektor masif)
  PdfWorker -> PdfWorker : Beralih otomatis ke "Mode Laporan Ringkas (Teks & Tabel Matriks Kompak)"
  PdfWorker -> Storage : Tulis berkas PDF Ringkas tanpa grafik visual berat
  activate Storage
  Storage --> PdfWorker : CompactPdfUploaded
  deactivate Storage
  PdfWorker --> ReportSvc : CompactPdfCompleted
  deactivate PdfWorker
  activate ReportSvc
  ReportSvc -> UI : WebSocket push: EVENT_REPORT_PDF_READY (mode='COMPACT_FALLBACK')
  deactivate ReportSvc
  activate UI
  UI --> User : Tampilkan toast: "Laporan diterbitkan dalam format ringkas (teks & tabel) demi stabilitas render"
  deactivate UI
end

deactivate User

@enduml
